OL,3,GNEWSADead robins and roasted rats on   
OL,4,AChristmas cards                        
OL,6,FA murderous frog fleeing the scene of a
OL,7,Fstabbing, bloodthirsty fairies roasting
OL,8,Fa rat over an open fire and a dead     
OL,9,Frobin lying in the snow - not your     
OL,10,Faverage Christmas cards.               
OL,12,FBut these grisly greeting cards are    
OL,13,Famong a collection from Victorian times
OL,14,Fthat are being reissued by English     
OL,15,FHeritage.                              
OL,17,FThe charity has unveiled four          
OL,18,Freproductions from the 19th Century,   
OL,19,Fhighlighting what it says was a far    
OL,20,Fdarker and stranger side of Victorian  
OL,21,FChristmas than many people might       
OL,22,Fexpect.                                
